  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large clay pot or Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger; cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the cumin powder, cinnamon powder, and paprika; cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chicken pieces and cook until browned on all sides, about 5-7 minutes.",
    "Add the chicken broth, salt, and black pepper; bring to a simmer.",
    "Cover the pot and transfer to the oven; bake at 325°F (165°C) for 25-30 minutes.",
    "Add the green cardamom pods and continue to cook for an additional 10-15 minutes.",
    "Remove from the oven and let rest for 10 minutes before serving."
  ],
